<%# Geoapify returns this attribution with every record it serves, because the places and
    addresses underneath are OpenStreetMap's, licensed under the Open Database Licence.
    Shared rather than copied into each feature, so all three carry the same line with the
    same gap above it as the weather and transport credits. Not translated: it is the
    attribution string the licence asks for, and a proper noun besides. %>
<br /><br />
<div class='credit'>
  <%= credit_link '© OpenStreetMap contributors', 'https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright' %>
</div>
